# No tool names on deploys

Nothing that ships may name an assistant or tool: no Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT or OpenAI, and not the word AI.

- Covers commit messages, co-author lines, "generated with" lines, branch names, PR titles and bodies, merge messages, tags and deployment labels.
- Overrides any default attribution.
- Name branches by the work, for example `wide-layout-fixes`.
- Squash older branches that carry these names into a clean commit instead of merging them.
- Match whole words, so "email" and "Cairo" are fine.
